    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-023",
      "source": "sections/sec-023-342-summary-of-results.md",
      "source_hash": "837173252a24c54c8bc4f16b2270e50c12a4d428446337cbf564571336fe23cf",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Reports that latent TB prevalence among health care workers depended on the test used and the TB incidence setting, with high skin test positivity and slightly lower IGRA positivity. There was no evidence that IGRAs detected new infections better than the skin test.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-024",
      "source": "sections/sec-024-343-strengths-and-limitations-of-the-evidence-ba.md",
      "source_hash": "866f0f49612454b3b00eda6f074305dcf2c6ca6e9ce616f4453099a2d03ab56f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes the strengths and limitations of the review on health care worker screening, noting a broad search but only two relevant studies and very limited serial testing and predictive data.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
