      "source_hash": "dd755ca06cc6c1274112982ebe7a0c45ad27e5a57115c7eae8ef8d595edcbd0f",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes the studies on IGRAs in contact screening and outbreak investigations in low- and middle-income countries after excluding high-income and in-house assay studies. Most were small and few reported blinding of test interpretation.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-028",
      "source": "sections/sec-028-352-summary-of-results.md",
      "source_hash": "bf7aef6647035b3d8ebd3c5b89f398ae12fcba647d2e4a47331baf5e65ef1d23",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Reports widely varying rates of positive skin tests and IGRAs among contacts across studies and groups, with generally comparable detection of latent TB. It notes manufacturer support for some studies, including kit donations.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-029",
      "source": "sections/sec-029-353-strengths-and-limitations-of-the-evidence-ba.md",
      "source_hash": "f16646e3686fc8c53af23fbce6ab99678900563be914622deece23aef010fad0",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Explains that data on contact screening could not be pooled because of heterogeneity, and that most studies were cross-sectional with inconsistent exposure categories.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-030",
      "source": "sections/sec-030-354-grade-evidence-profiles-and-final-policy-rec.md",
      "source_hash": "805670d3c1bb1d31626dc74ef2adb397b819c7a1fa5c547aedf82d0064f8ea30",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Presents the strong recommendation that IGRAs not replace the skin test for latent TB screening of adult and child contacts or in outbreak investigations in low- and middle-income countries.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-031",
      "source": "sections/sec-031-36-the-predictive-value-of-igras-for-incident-ac.md",
      "source_hash": "b1796112ce6b25d5cc70488da19df0ade89cdf5c01052cc30059b79adea27da6",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "A section heading for the predictive value of IGRAs for incident active TB.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
