          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-032",
      "source": "sections/sec-032-361-study-characteristics.md",
      "source_hash": "9141d217a93eb1c629080bbdb000d3ac0535aed01bfa3510141eb87da913f4b6",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Describes the three eligible studies on whether IGRAs predict progression to active TB in low- and middle-income countries, noting differing populations and risks of verification and incorporation bias.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-033",
      "source": "sections/sec-033-362-summary-of-results.md",
      "source_hash": "190640f964de7ed2cc44ff7e9928fe098ffc26074a0c2f93a44ca2033fa9fc87",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Reports that over 95% of people with positive IGRAs did not develop active TB during follow-up. IGRAs and the skin test performed comparably in predicting disease.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-034",
      "source": "sections/sec-034-363-grade-evidence-profiles-and-final-policy-rec.md",
      "source_hash": "683ffae9d4b14f304f968d3e0aa4792cb9e19a7ebcbf9b3f4ada2cb7c1ff27cd",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Presents the strong recommendation that neither IGRAs nor the skin test be used in low- and middle-income settings to predict which individuals will develop active TB.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-035",
      "source": "sections/sec-035-4-operational-aspects-on-the-use-of-igras.md",
      "source_hash": "36dbfeab8b28ae71a955acab53a9713daf18f18736f0c7ac93c9e775d57055e9",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Summarizes the limited evidence on operational aspects of IGRAs, such as high cost, reproducibility and indeterminate results, and their need for well-equipped laboratories and trained staff. It contrasts these with the skin test's practical limitations.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-036",
      "source": "sections/sec-036-5-overall-conclusions.md",
      "source_hash": "5e4496138a35209d14789a36adda47748f638e0098c8bc49b4bf1152a5e7b7a5",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Sets out the overall conclusions that evidence on IGRAs in low- and middle-income countries is limited and of low quality, neither test predicts progression or diagnoses active TB, and replacing the skin test with costlier IGRAs is not recommended.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
          },
          "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "block": "library/10665-44759/blocks/prose-sec-037",
      "source": "sections/sec-037-6-implications-for-further-research.md",
      "source_hash": "0724d883e6290e5b7532fee46ca497e038b4c3f946b09ba54718b6fd44526f79",
      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Calls for well-designed research on more accurate IGRAs, including representative populations, prospective follow-up, blinding and evaluation of patient impact.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
          "drafted_by": {
            "kind": "agent",
            "id": "claude-code",
            "model": "not-disclosed",
            "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt6Ag2x8GsfdRq4ALsz"
