      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The selected references for the IGRA policy statement, citing mainly the systematic reviews and meta-analyses on IGRAs in active TB, children, HIV, health care workers and contacts. The extracted block also runs into the GRADE evidence tables. These set out study numbers, quality ratings and findings for each outcome. Its final rows note that no studies addressed serial IGRA testing to predict active TB.",
