      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "The front matter of WHO's 2011 policy statement on the use of tuberculosis interferon-gamma release assays (IGRAs) in low- and middle-income countries. It includes cataloguing and copyright details, the table of contents and summary material. It ends with declarations of interest, explaining that experts with IGRA research links and the systematic reviewers did not take part in the GRADE evaluation or in forming recommendations.",
